  "2026-08-12T00:18:01.538Z",codex,"Duplicate check: searched all statuses for pm-cli dependency, CI health, history drift, and 2026.8.11. Prior pmc-58zs and pmc-licw are earlier version-specific adoption/lock refreshes; this distinct 2026.8.11 compatibility update is linked to them and to the strict health gate pmc-vm22."
  "2026-08-12T00:23:19.499Z",codex,"Evidence: @unbrained/pm-cli resolves and dedupes at 2026.8.11. pm history pmc-874d --verify --full reports ok=true and matching b854da1e hashes. pm health reports zero drift. The exact-baseline jq assertion passes locally and npm audit --audit-level low reports zero vulnerabilities."
  "2026-08-12T00:26:10.793Z",codex,"Final evidence: npm run release:check exits 0 after terminal metadata and generator-owned changelog regeneration: typecheck, 136-declaration docstring gate, 372 tests, 100/100/100 source coverage, production audit, dry-run pack, and changelog check all pass. GitHub Node 22/26 proof remains pending on the pushed exact head."
  "2026-08-12T00:26:35.942Z",codex,"Merge-safety evidence: pm merge install reports the v2 managed fence current with no further change; git attributes resolve pmc-ypbc.toon to pm-item-toon and its history stream to pm-history; strict history-drift validation checks 133 items with zero missing, unreadable, hash, or chain mismatches."
